    "Description": "Governs what happens when you die.\n\n[Casual]: You do not drop equipped gear, skills are reduced a lot less than on normal mode.\n\n[Very Easy]: You drop all items, skills are reduced a lot less than on normal mode.\n\n[Easy]: You drop all items, skills are reduced less than on normal mode.\n\n[Hard]: Equipped items are dropped, the rest of your inventory is lost permanently, skills are reduced faster.\n\n[Hardcore]: You lose all carrie items and skills permanently.",
